aecho multi-tap echo (src/audio/aecho.ts)

src/audio/aecho.ts adapts FFmpeg libavfilter/af_aecho.c: the in_gain/out_gain/
delays/decays options, init()'s list counting (count_items, fill_items with
av_strtok skipping empty fields) and its count and range checks,
config_output()'s tap sample counts ((int)(float(delay * sample_rate) / 1000.0))
and max_samples check, the echo_samples_<fmt>p loops (shared delay_index, MOD
ring indexing, float tap products, av_clipd and C conversion), the
FILTER_SAMPLEFMTS list (s16p, s32p, fltp, dblp) and request_frame()'s
max_samples tail in frames of at most 2048 samples continuing next_pts.

Fixed FFmpeg commit:946fcce07b6dcd0331c8cc609192aeff5e1924f8
